  M->>A: Signed messages webhook
  A->>S: Store image once by WhatsApp message ID
  A->>M: Send fixed acknowledgement
  A->>A: Create pharmacist_review_requested once
  D->>A: Poll review events after cursor
  A-->>D: Versioned event with photo references

